sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant SQL as database/sql
    participant Export as Exporter
    App->>SQL: QueryContext
    SQL->>Export: End existing query span
    SQL->>SQL: Register callbacks under closemu
    SQL-->>App: Return Rows
    Note over App,SQL: No live rows span<br/>between reads
    loop Successful Next calls
        App->>SQL: Next
        SQL->>SQL: Count observed row
        SQL-->>App: Row available
        Note over App: Scan and caller work
    end
    App->>SQL: Final EOF or Close
    Note over SQL: Cancellation also<br/>uses private close
    SQL->>SQL: Clear callbacks once, release lock
    SQL->>Export: Emit sql.rows
    Note over SQL,Export: Child of query<br/>observed timestamps and row count
